s="text-primary mt-5 space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19.7998 6.59961L10.1221 19.5039L4.30762 13.9219L5.69238 12.4785L9.87793 16.4961L18.2002 5.40039L19.7998 6.59961Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>Live citations from primary sources across the web</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19.7998 6.59961L10.1221 19.5039L4.30762 13.9219L5.69238 12.4785L9.87793 16.4961L18.2002 5.40039L19.7998 6.59961Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>Real-time 𝕏 integration for breaking news and trends</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19.7998 6.59961L10.1221 19.5039L4.30762 13.9219L5.69238 12.4785L9.87793 16.4961L18.2002 5.40039L19.7998 6.59961Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>Follow-up questions drill deeper into any topic</span></li></ul><div class="mt-6 lg:hidden"><div class="relative h-[360px]"><div class="grok-browser-theme bg-card text-ash dark:text-dove border-primary/[0.06] flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border"><div class="relative flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col pb-4 px-4"><div class="relative flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex h-full flex-col"><div tabindex="-1" class="flex-1 space-y-4 overflow-hidden px-1 pb-3 pt-5 outline-none"></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 shrink-0"><div aria-hidden="false" s