th="2"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:flex lg:min-h-[50vh] lg:flex-col lg:justify-center"><div class="py-10 transition-opacity duration-500 lg:py-12 lg:opacity-20"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] text-primary size-7"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 4 H16 A4 4 0 0 1 20 8 V16 A4 4 0 0 1 16 20 H8 A4 4 0 0 1 4 16 V8 A4 4 0 0 1 8 4 Z M4 12 a5 5 0 0 1 6 8 M4 16.5 c2.333-.5 8-.5 9-2 S11 13 11 13"></path><circle cx="15.25" cy="8.75" r="1.75" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><h3 class="font-display text-2xl tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">Imagine</h3></div><p class="text-primary mt-4 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed">Generate images and video from text prompts or reference photos. Restyle, edit, and iterate without leaving the conversation.</p><ul class="text-primary mt-5 space-y-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19.7998 6.59961L10.1221 19.5039L4.30762 13.9219L5.69238 12.4785L9.87793 16.4961L18.2002 5.40039L19.7998 6.59961Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>Text-to-image and text-to-video in one thread</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19.7998 6.59961L10.1221 19.5039L4.30762 13.9219L5.69238 12.4785L9.87793 16.4961L18.2002 5.40039L19.7998 6.59961Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>Edit generated content with follow-up prompts</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19.7998 6.59961L10.1221 19.5039L4.30762 13.9219L5.69238 12.4785L9.87793 16.4961L18.2002 5.40039L19.7998 6.59961Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>Up to 2K resolution and 15-second videos</span></li></ul><div class="mt-6 lg:hidden"><div class="relative h-[360px]"><div class="grok-browser-theme bg-card text-ash dark:text-dove border-primary/[0.06] flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border"><div class="relative flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col pb-4 px-4"><div class="relative flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex h-full flex-col"><div tabindex="-1" class="flex-1 space-y-4 overflow-hidden px-1 pb-3 pt-5 outline-none"><div class="space-y-4" style="opacity:0"></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 shrink-0"><div aria-hidden="false" style="pointer-events:auto;opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="dark:bg-charcoal flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-black/[0.06] bg-white/95 px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] dark:border-white/[0.06] sm:px-2.5"><button type="button" aria-label="Add attachment" class="flex size-7 shrink-0 cursor-default items-center justify-center rounded-full text-black/60 dark:text-white/70"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] text-secondary size-[18px]" stroke-width="1.75"><path d="M6 12H18M12 6V18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square"></path></svg></button><div class="relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap leading-[20px]"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-black/40 dark:text-white/40">What do you want to know?<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-[1px] inline-block align-middle bg-black/60 dark:bg-white/60" style="width:2