an></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="mx-auto w-full px-4 lg:px-6 xl:max-w-7xl border-border border-t py-16 sm:py-24"><div class="mb-12 max-w-lg"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">And much more</h2><p class="text-primary mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">Everything you need in one assistant — from everyday tasks to deep research.</p></div><div class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-9 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-px size-[18px] shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M17.5 17 L20.5 20 M19 10.75 A7.75 7.75 0 1 0 3.5 10.75 A7.75 7.75 0 1 0 19 10.75 Z"></path></svg><div><p class="text-primary/80 text-sm font-medium">Real-time web search</p><p class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 text-xs leading-relaxed">Answers grounded in live sources across the web</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-px size-[18px] shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M5 14.25L14 4L13 9.75H19L10 20L11 14.25H5Z" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div><p class="text-primary/80 text-sm font-medium">Live 𝕏 integration</p><p class="text-primary/60 mt-0.5 text-xs leading-relaxed">Breaking news, trends, and posts as they happen</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] mt-px size-[18px] shrink-0 text-primary/30" stroke-width="1.5"><g id="style=brain"><path id="vector" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M20 4.94531C20 7.39527 20.0469 8.03589 22 9.5V14.5C20.0469 15.9641 20 16.6047 20 19.0547L15.1309 22.